The dashboard bundles Space Grotesk and Libre Franklin, obtained from Google
Fonts. Both fonts use the SIL Open Font License 1.1. Their original copyright
notices and license text are in dashboard/assets/fonts/spacegrotesk-OFL.txt and
dashboard/assets/fonts/librefranklin-OFL.txt. File sources and checksums are
recorded in dashboard/assets/fonts/sources.json.

The dashboard bundles MapLibre GL JS 6.11.2 under the BSD 3-Clause license.
Its license and file sources are in dashboard/assets/vendor/maplibre.
The street basemap is served by OpenFreeMap using OpenMapTiles and
OpenStreetMap data. Map credits link to their attribution pages; these
third-party data terms remain separate from the Earthcraft source license.
